Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=Eleven here. Roger that. Confirmed. The boss is on his way? Good. Yes. Everything is ready. Is he with his friends? Any word yet on who they are? Alright... well let me know so my guys don't shoot them. Roger. Eleven out.

